<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LINDUM PASSES FINAL DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>LINDUM PASSES FINAL DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lindum Reefs Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday it had decided to pass the final dividend for the year ending June 30 due to the continuing depressed gold price and inadequate production results.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
